# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Signing
#
# The release key is NOT in this repo. It lives in CI as a repository secret
# and is restored at build time; see RELEASING.md.
#
# The signing certificate is embedded in every published APK, so a key that sits
# in a public repo is a key anyone can use to sign an update. The key that was
# committed here was rotated when the repo went public.
keystore/
keystore.properties

# Tools
#
# The theme generator in tools/theme-gen is committed, because the generated
# colour schemes are only reproducible if the thing that produced them is too.
# Its dependencies are not.
tools/theme-gen/node_modules/

# Docs books
#
# The learn, pocket and app books are built locally (build.mjs writes their
# HTML from the markdown beside it). They are drafts, so they stay off the repo
# until they are worth publishing.
docs/app/
docs/learn/
docs/pocket/

# Local tool state
.hallmark/

# Firebase
#
# This repository is public. The client key in google-services.json is not a
# secret in the sense that it can sign anything, but it is an API key tied to
# one Firebase project, and committing it hands every reader a quota to burn.
# The release workflow does not use it; push notifications are not wired yet.
app/google-services.json
